title: With "Show code lenses" off nothing is asked and nothing is drawn
folders: rust-small
extensions: views-extension
prefs: {"code_lenses": false}
forbid-log: code lenses for
expect-log: script: no code lenses in src/main\.rs

wait 3000
goto src/main.rs
wait 3000
lens report src/main.rs
mark no-lenses
wait 600
quit
